#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:5 2a5cbaac42dd44cb8fa54b6c3371d373
msgid "ROS 2 over Ethernet"
msgstr "通过以太网使用 ROS 2"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:7 a12124caeae94f1aa52e291dde89c384
msgid ""
"The following tutorial explains how to connect a flight controller to a "
"companion computer using ethernet for DDS communication."
msgstr "以下教程介绍如何通过以太网将飞控连接到伴飞计算机以进行 DDS 通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:9 dc5d913c8278431f8f65cfd3c230a6f3
msgid ""
"Ensure you have ROS 2 :ref:`installed <ros2>` and have run :ref:`SITL "
"<ros2-sitl>` successfully before attempting this page."
msgstr "在尝试本页内容之前，请确保已 :ref:`安装 <ros2>` ROS 2 并成功运行过 :ref:`SITL <ros2-sitl>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:11
#: 06415444cfb240d7947c98b0952355bc
msgid ""
"Additionally, make sure you understand the :ref:`basics of networking in "
"ArduPilot. <common-network>`"
msgstr "此外，请确保您了解 :ref:`ArduPilot 网络基础知识。<common-network>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:13
#: 4fe182f5b4204dd98033e196e0b9b687
msgid ""
"ROS2 (via DDS) is not part of the standard ArduPilot build. Use the `Custom "
"Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ and ensure "
"\"MicroXRCE DDS support for ROS 2\" is checked."
msgstr ""
"ROS 2（通过 DDS）不属于 ArduPilot 标准构建的一部分。请使用 `自定义构建服务器 "
"<https://custom.ardupilot.org/add_build>`__ 并确保勾选「MicroXRCE DDS support for "
"ROS 2」。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:16
#: 015e31252b7c41b79a9133226b11cb32
msgid "Motivation"
msgstr "背景动机"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:18
#: fd6918e45ff94d07863489787b69d609
msgid ""
"Starting in ArduPilot 4.5, ethernet is now supported as a new communication "
"interface. Compared to connecting an autopilot over serial, ethernet has the"
" following advantages:"
msgstr "从 ArduPilot 4.5 开始，以太网作为一种新的通信接口得到支持。与串口连接相比，以太网具有以下优势："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:21
#: 6e53d48366cf4d599eafb8ada6d05426
msgid "Ethernet is more immune to noise because it uses twisted pair wiring"
msgstr "以太网使用双绞线，抗干扰能力更强"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:22
#: 8f0c903152014263a738bf86d7ded100
msgid ""
"Ethernet can run multiple protocols over the same protocol (unless you use "
"PPP)"
msgstr "以太网可以在同一链路上运行多种协议（PPP 除外）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:23
#: 06ea36fbfd0049eebe2edaa33ae724a3
msgid ""
"Ethernet is easier to debug with tools such as ``tcpdump`` or ``Wireshark``"
msgstr "以太网可以使用 ``tcpdump`` 或 ``Wireshark`` 等工具更方便地调试"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:24
#: a92b401fcb3f4c628ac299d3bb50ecf4
msgid ""
"Ethernet uses standard cabling, so it's more difficult to mix up TX and RX"
msgstr "以太网使用标准线缆，不易混淆发送端与接收端"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-over-ethernet.rst:27
#: 29b792f1a9814476aba05d143a5284cf
